 "text": "In 1962, America's top generals approved a plan to fake attacks on Americans and blame Cuba. It was called Operation Northwoods. The ideas? A terror campaign in Miami, blow up a U.S. ship, fake the shoot-down of a passenger plane. Here's the trick. Fear makes people want war. Give them an enemy and they'll follow. Kennedy's administration rejected it. The plan stayed secret until 1997. Follow for more dark psychology.",
